The lefts is a list of 2, 3, 5, 15, and 19.
The rights is a list of 9, 7, 12, 20, and 24.
The highs is a list of 10, 15, 12, 10, and 8.
The sky is a list of 25 zeros.
The total is 5.
For every building from 0 to total minus 1.
The left is item building of lefts.
The right is item building of rights.
The high is item building of highs.
For every spot from left to right minus 1.
If item spot of sky is less than high, set item spot of sky to high.

The previous is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 24.
The current is item spot of sky.
If current is not previous, Report spot, Report current, Report "---", set previous to current.
